# The losing path, which nothing else in this corpus takes: the lead is far
# too weak, the party faints, and the game whites out and moves the player.
# A battle station that only ever wins never executes the half of the battle
# code a player meets most often early on.

name FIGHTER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20009
money 4000
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 5 ITEM_NONE
# The lead's first move is set explicitly. A battle station is driven
# with A alone, which picks move slot 0 every turn, so a lead whose
# natural slot 0 is a status move never ends its fight, measured on a
# level 22 Monferno, which drew a level 5 Starly out past 40,000 frames.
party-move 0 0 MOVE_RAZOR_LEAF
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
